  "grammar": [
    {
      "title": "Classifiers: ଟି, ଟା, ଜଣ, ଖଣ୍ଡ",
      "body": "When you count nouns in Odia, a **classifier** goes between the number and the noun:\n\n**-ଟି** (*-ṭi*) for things (neutral, polite): ଦୁଇଟି ଆମ୍ବ 'two mangoes'. 'One' is the special form **ଗୋଟିଏ**.\n**-ଟା** (*-ṭa*) is the casual version: ଦୁଇଟା ଆମ୍ବ. (It can sound dismissive when used for people.)\n**ଜଣ** (*jôṇô*) for people: ତିନି ଜଣ ଲୋକ. 'One person' is **ଜଣେ**.\n**ଖଣ୍ଡ** (*khôṇḍô*) for flat things and pieces: ଦୁଇ ଖଣ୍ଡ କାଗଜ 'two sheets of paper'; 'one piece' is **ଖଣ୍ଡେ**.\n\nAttached directly to a noun, ଟି/ଟା act like English **'the'**: ବହିଟି 'the book', ପିଲାଟି 'the child'. For plural 'the', use -ଗୁଡ଼ିକ / -ମାନେ (Unit 3).",
      "examples": [
        { "native": "ମୋତେ ଦୁଇଟି ଆମ୍ବ ଦିଅନ୍ତୁ।", "roman": "mote duiṭi ambô diôntu.", "en": "Please give me two mangoes." },
        { "native": "ତିନି ଜଣ ଲୋକ ଆସିଲେ।", "roman": "tini jôṇô lokô asile.", "en": "Three people came." },
        { "native": "ଗୋଟିଏ ଚା, ଦୁଇଟା ବିସ୍କୁଟ୍।", "roman": "goṭie cha, duiṭa biskuṭ.", "en": "One tea, two biscuits." },
        { "native": "ପିଲାଟି କାନ୍ଦୁଛି।", "roman": "pilaṭi kanduchhi.", "en": "The child is crying." },
        { "native": "ଦୁଇ ଖଣ୍ଡ କାଗଜ ଦିଅ।", "roman": "dui khôṇḍô kagôjô diô.", "en": "Give me two sheets of paper. (familiar)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Asking how many, how much, how old",
      "body": "**କେତେ** (*kete*) asks 'how much / how many' in general; **କେତୋଟି** asks 'how many (things)' and **କେତେ ଜଣ** 'how many (people)'. Age is ବୟସ 'age': ଆପଣଙ୍କ ବୟସ କେତେ? 'Your age how-much?' — answer ମୋ ବୟସ … ବର୍ଷ.\n\nOrdinals are Sanskrit words (ପ୍ରଥମ, ଦ୍ୱିତୀୟ, ତୃତୀୟ …) and come before the noun like adjectives. In casual speech people often use *number*: ତିନି ନମ୍ବର ବସ୍ 'bus number three', or the native form ପହିଲା (*pôhila*) 'first'.",
      "examples": [
        { "native": "ମୋ ବୟସ ତିରିଶି ବର୍ଷ।", "roman": "mo bôyôsô tirisi bôrsô.", "en": "I'm thirty years old." },
        { "native": "ଆପଣଙ୍କର କେତେ ଜଣ ପିଲା?", "roman": "apôṇôṅkôrô kete jôṇô pila?", "en": "How many children do you have?" },
        { "native": "କେତୋଟି ଆମ୍ବ ଦରକାର?", "roman": "ketoṭi ambô dôrôkarô?", "en": "How many mangoes do you need?" },
        { "native": "ମୁଁ ତୃତୀୟ ମହଲାରେ ରହେ।", "roman": "muṃ trutiyô môhôlare rôhe.", "en": "I live on the third floor." },
        { "native": "ଏହା ମୋର ଦ୍ୱିତୀୟ ଥର।", "roman": "eha morô dwitiyô thôrô.", "en": "This is my second time." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dialogue": {
