      { "speaker": "Sam", "native": "ବାଃ, ବହୁତ ବଡ଼ ପରିବାର।", "roman": "baḥ, bôhutô bôṛô pôribarô.", "en": "Wow, a very big family." },
      { "speaker": "Jejema", "native": "ହଁ। ଆଉ ଗୋଟିଏ ରସଗୋଲା ଖାଅ।", "roman": "hôṃ. au goṭie rôsôgola khaô.", "en": "Yes. Have one more rasagola." },
      { "speaker": "Sam", "native": "ନା ଜେଜେମା, ବହୁତ ବେଶି ହେଲାଣି!", "roman": "na jejema, bôhutô besi helaṇi!", "en": "No, Grandma, it's already too much!" }
    ]
